# kit cooldowns as a normal player (test2.script deopped Tester and used the kits); a new connection, so the
# vanilla command-spam counter starts at zero
wait 2
cmd kit tools
expect Received kit tools.
wait 2
cmd kit tools
expect You can't use that kit again for another
wait 2
cmd kit once
expect You need the essentials.kits.once permission to use that kit.
wait 2
cmd fly
expect You do not have access to that command.
expect-none panicked
